@marketData = http://localhost:8001

### health
GET {{marketData}}/health

### providers and one runtime detail
GET {{marketData}}/providers

###
GET {{marketData}}/providers/FINNHUB/health

### snapshot - current spots + curves
GET {{marketData}}/market-data/snapshot

### filter the normalized quote board
GET {{marketData}}/market-data/quotes?symbol=AAPL&asset_class=EQUITY

### one provider-symbol quote
GET {{marketData}}/market-data/quotes/FINNHUB/AAPL

### immediate fetch within the provider budget
POST {{marketData}}/market-data/refresh?symbol=AAPL&provider=FINNHUB

### Run SSE requests individually; each remains open waiting for events
GET {{marketData}}/market-data/stream/FINNHUB

###
GET {{marketData}}/market-data/stream
